Medical Chat Bot: Using Cloud Gemini APi, and SNOWFLAKE API    
The user could feed information to the chatbot relating to the symptoms they are feeling, 
and the chatbot would be able to narrow it down and give the user condensed information. 
For example, if the user says they are feeling chills, body aches, has a fever, sore throat, etc. 
The chatbot might say you have a common cold and tell them household remedies that could alleviate their condition. 
Alternatively, for more severe cases it could advise to seek medical professionals immediately. 
For example if they list the above symptoms but they have an extremely high blood pressure or an extremely high temperature, 
the chatbot could advise a visit to the emergency room or local urgent care.  

